  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xF6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project consists of production/distribution of litterature in Kurmanji and Zaza in Turkey. The objective is to publish/distribute litterature for children/youth/adults to stimulate the use of Zaza/ Kurmanji, to stregnhthen the cultural identity, and to contribute to the writing down and thereby the preservation of the tales and the oral tradition in the community.</narrative>
  </description>
